cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite both the archived release and the article it supports."
title: >-
  Incremental value of antenatal diagnoses for outcome-specific prediction of
  pregnancy complications: analysis code
abstract: >-
  Analysis code for time-stratified gradient-boosted models estimating the
  incremental predictive value of diagnoses recorded during pregnancy over
  pre-pregnancy history alone, for six pregnancy complications. Models are
  fitted on pregnancy episodes reconstructed from Indonesian national health
  insurance claims and validated without refitting on the Taipei Medical
  University Clinical Research Database.

type: software
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/dca-nug/ML-Preg"

# TODO: version and date are set at release time and must match the GitHub tag.
version: 1.0.0
